{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-140-1","title":"Psalms 140:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David prays to be delivered from Saul and Doeg. 8 He prays against them. 12 He comforts himself by confidence in God.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2942. B.C. 1062. Deliver. 43:1; 59:1-3; 71:4 violent man. Heb. man of violences. 4,11; 18:48; *marg: Hab 1:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-2","title":"Psalms 140:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>imagine. 2:1,2; 21:11; 36:4; 38:12; 62:3; 64:5,6; Pr 12:20; Ho 7:6; Mic 2:1-3 Na 1:11 continually. 56:6; 120:7; 1Sa 23:19-24; 24:11,12; 26:1-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-3","title":"Psalms 140:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>sharpened. 52:2,3; 57:4; 59:7; 64:3,4; Pr 12:18; Isa 59:3-5,13; Jer 9:3,5 Jas 3:6-8 like a serpent. Ge 3:13; Pr 23:32; Mt 12:34; 2Co 11:3 adders. 58:4; Ro 3:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-4","title":"Psalms 140:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Keep me. 17:8,9; 36:11; 37:32,33-40; 55:1-3; 71:4 preserve. 1 overthrow. 17:5; Pr 18:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-5","title":"Psalms 140:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>The proud. 10:4-12; 17:8-13; 35:7; 36:11; 57:6; 119:69,85,110; 123:3,4 141:9,10; 142:3; Pr 29:5; Jer 18:18,20,22; Lu 11:53,54; 20:20-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-6","title":"Psalms 140:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I said unto. 16:2,5,6; 31:14; 91:2; 119:57; 142:5; La 3:24; Zec 13:9 hear. 27:7,8; 28:1,2; 55:1,2; 64:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-7","title":"Psalms 140:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the strength. 18:1,2,35; 27:1; 28:7,8; 59:17; 62:2,7; 89:26; 95:1; De 33:27-29 Isa 12:2 thou hast covered. 144:10; 1Sa 17:36,37,45-51; 2Sa 8:6,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-8","title":"Psalms 140:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Grant not. 27:12; 94:20,21; 2Sa 15:31; Job 5:12,13 lest they exalt themselves. or, let them not be exalted. De 32:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-9","title":"Psalms 140:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>let the mischief. 7:16; 64:8; 94:23; Es 5:14; 7:10; Pr 10:6,11; 12:13; 18:7; Mt 27:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-10","title":"Psalms 140:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>burning coals. 11:6; 18:13,14; 21:9; 120:4; Ge 19:24; Ex 9:23,24; Re 16:8,9 let them. Da 3:20-25; Mt 13:42,50 into deep. 55:23; Pr 28:10,17; Re 20:15; 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-11","title":"Psalms 140:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Let not, etc. or, Let not an evil speaker a wicked man of violence be established in the earth: let him be hunted to his overthrow.</p>\n<p>an evil speaker. Heb. a man of tongue. 12:3,4; Pr 6:17; 12:13; 17:20; 18:21 evil. 7:14-16; 9:16; 34:21; Pr 13:21; Isa 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-12","title":"Psalms 140:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the Lord. 9:4; 10:17,18; 22:24; 72:4,12-14; 102:17; 1Ki 8:45,49; Pr 22:22 Pr 23:10,11; Isa 11:4; Jer 22:16; Mt 11:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-140-13","title":"Psalms 140:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":140,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":140,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Surely. 32:11; 33:1; Isa 3:10 the upright. 16:11; 23:6; 73:24; Joh 14:3; 17:24; 1Th 4:17; Re 7:14-17; 21:24-27</p>"}]}